  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="917cb1f8-ed3e-5830-9b24-f0fb7f338f1c" activityNameId="7a4a3270-cad2-54b9-9a90-c02e45df8b78" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 300, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 300, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 58660f0b-c1e3-4a7b-b471-5465c3876a6e
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with HDPE-pipe. SN 2-4, DN 300, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with HDPE-pipe, DN 300, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 2-4, DN 300, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. HDPE-pipe, ID 277-285 mm, outer diameter 315 mm, wall thickness 15-18 mm, 14.8-15.6 kg/m, 910-930 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_58660f0b-c1e3-4a7b-b471-5465c3876a6e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
